      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Nothing arrives unexamined",
      "items": [
        "Plugins come from an administrator-managed pool, never straight from the internet",
        "A compatibility mismatch is rejected before it reaches a running instance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Isolated once enabled",
      "items": [
